%X An illustrated children's storybook that follows Drosie the fruit fly through the life cycle, the laboratory and the discoveries scientists have made with fruit flies.
%Z Illustrated by Letícia Cavalcanti

%0 Computer Program
%A Arzoo, Shahira Helal
%T The Secret Fly Lab
%I Drosie's World
%9 Interactive educational game
%U https://drosiesworld.com/lab/
%X A story-led science game for ages 5 to 8: a Safety Academy, a stereomicroscope, fly anatomy and an observation mystery. It is a simulation made for learning.

%0 Computer Program
%A Arzoo, Shahira Helal
%T Drosie's Climbing Challenge
%I Drosie's World
%9 Interactive educational game
%U https://drosiesworld.com/climbing-game.html
%X A virtual-lab game in which learners predict, observe and record the climbing of ten simulated fruit flies.

%0 Computer Program
%A Arzoo, Shahira Helal
%T Drosie Genetics Lab
%I Drosie's World
%9 Interactive educational simulation
%U https://drosiesworld.com/drosie-genetics-lab/
%X A browser-based Drosophila genetics simulator: breed virtual flies, predict offspring with Punnett squares, explore chromosomes and test data with chi-square. Offspring data are simulated.

%0 Computer Program
%A Arzoo, Shahira Helal
%T Drosie's Lab Notebook Academy
%I Drosie's World
%9 Interactive educational simulation
%U https://drosiesworld.com/lab-notebook-academy.html
%X An interactive apprenticeship on how scientists keep honest laboratory notebooks, with printable notebook pages and a teacher and parent guide. It is not a validated professional electronic lab notebook.

%0 Computer Program
%A Arzoo, Shahira Helal
%T Drosie's First Scientific Conference
%I Drosie's World
%9 Interactive educational simulation
%U https://drosiesworld.com/scientific-conference.html
%X A simulated scientific conference for ages 7 to 12: investigate a simulated fruit fly experiment or your own project, write an abstract, build a poster and practise presenting.

%0 Computer Program
%A Arzoo, Shahira Helal
%T Drosie's Life Cycle Adventure
%I Drosie's World
%9 Interactive educational game
%U https://drosiesworld.com/life-cycle-game.html
%X An interactive game about the fruit fly life cycle (egg, larva, pupa and adult). Illustrations are simplified and times are approximate.

%0 Computer Program
%A Arzoo, Shahira Helal
%T Grow Your Own Fruit Fly
%I Drosie's World
%9 Interactive educational simulation
%U https://drosiesworld.com/grow-your-own-fruit-fly.html
%X A virtual fruit fly laboratory for ages 5 to 10: prepare food, set up a culture, observe development and make a lab report. It is a simulation with no live animals.

